    {
      "path": "/projects/0/description",
      "value": "The project aimed to enhance Pinkerton is the leading Service institution that provides services such as advisory, Security, Investigations, and other services to corporations or large businesses, as required to individual members of the public, Commercial business by implementing a comprehensive solution integrated with Dynamics 365 Finance & Operations (F&O) and CRM. The objective was to streamline operations, automate business processes, and ensure seamless synchronization between financial, operational, and customer data. I was responsible for gathering business requirements, conducting fit-gap analysis, and preparing functional design documents. I collaborated closely with business stakeholders through workshops and client meetings to refine business rules and ensure the solution aligned with operational needs. A key aspect of the project involved designing and implementing integrations between Dynamics 365 modules to enable real-time data flow across systems, improving data accuracy and reducing manual intervention. Additionally, I supported the team in functional clarifications, provided end- user training, and delivered product demonstrations to business SMEs. This initiative resulted in improved operational efficiency, enhanced visibility into vehicle and fleet data, and empowered the client with better decision- making capabilities through integrated business intelligence.",
